{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52972","headline":"与郑辕薛晏游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 石笋高 · 崔全素","name":"与郑辕薛晏游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 石笋高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石笋生孤标，屹立青冥直。\n根横晓浪痕，箨卷春云色。\n棱棱长钧锋，应使山魅惕。\n（同前）（按：三诗原收郑辕诗後，题作「同赋」，今重爲拟题。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔全素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}